{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_08_end","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_08","title":"大夢","storyCode":"WR-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"2e1d02e2c22d6122c11e2e293e4ea52a19643c56dd1abe5cbf8178b556637bf3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"恍惚如夢醒，嵯峨遊歷畫卷十載，終於得見“夕”的真實面目。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"..........."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"................"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"心如止水。\n以你的年紀而言，很少見。\n白光湮沒，心思寂滅。萬事萬物正遠離你的軀體。\n最後，平穩的心湖開始重新泛起情感——\n——你感到悲哀？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"先生！莫怪小僧叨擾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"大夢終醒......過了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧只見得梅花開了十回，又謝過十次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我若不去提筆，畫中天地，亙古不變，何時有花開花謝了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"實不相瞞，小僧從進入那天岳畫卷之後，就始終心算時日，大抵真有這麼個歲月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......十年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你在我的畫裡，待了十年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"差不離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你一介雲遊僧，在我這裡浪費十年光陰，求個什麼，何苦來哉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，大夢一場，有吃有喝，還不用為凡俗所擾，更不用躲避天災，懼怕感染，小僧其實覺得頗為愜意呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算如此，你也一夢......十年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有人能在這麼漫長的日子裡保持初心。有些人，就乾脆忘記了自己是誰，永遠留在那畫卷之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦，當真可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"可你倒是一點也不害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"先生是個好心腸，一定會在那些人意識彌留之際，點醒他們的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？何出此言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"天岳山巔釣魚翁，不歸河畔織布嫗，無界原上持戟將，龍門客棧老闆娘......再到婆山鎮中說書人，先生已經提醒小僧多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"是小僧流連忘返，幾次將醒未醒，都將就著蒙混了過去。如此說來，小僧該道歉才是，在畫中多養一個活人，想必要耗費不少精力吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，你入山時秋風蕭瑟，如今不過入冬而已。發夢一場，片刻罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦！本來小僧確實擔心，會不會在這裡懈怠久了挨故人責駡，原來這現世不過短暫時光，心裡踏實了許多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你在天岳時就意識到了自身處境，明知一切皆為畫像，又何必浪費時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"因為小僧見夕娥奔月之真相，久久不能釋懷......真有狂人靠一己之力，想從天空那裡奪回摯愛，如此癡癲，卻反倒不讓人惋惜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯......若是我說，就算夕娥那份神意，也是我刻意而為畫上的——也是假的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"各國傳說、名著、典籍、神話，有多少是假，多少是與樸素生活無緣之物，那難道我們就要因為一個“假”字，否了它們的意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧以為，如此謬矣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"真是怪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"妙人怪人，一線之差，先生過獎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"和你師傅一個模樣，年紀不大，倒是一片赤子之心，心思澄澈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"既陪我打發了些許光陰......念在你那師傅的面子上，也好，便允你見我一面吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，見面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你真以為自己推門而入，便是醒來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......！莫非小僧此刻仍在畫中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"無須慚愧，本該如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真被你隨隨便便闖破了去，倒是有些不給我面子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"醒去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"星藏點雪。月隱晦明。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac16_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"起來吧，躺在地上，不像個樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！小僧得令......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"不......小僧......從未想過，原來先生本尊，竟是如此模樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧......小僧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧本以為走過百餘幅畫卷，至少得見先生大半閱歷，未曾想......不過是先生畫海之一隅，不值一提......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"不是沒有癡人執迷不悟，最終心甘情願，死在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是可以理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你想問的不是這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對，小僧一時震驚，把這事忘了，見諒見諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，小僧曾在住持爺爺的閣樓，見過那副《拙山盡起圖》，當時只覺得此中有真意，卻答不上個所以然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"問及住持爺爺，師傅他老人家也只讓小僧自己下山去找答案。小僧下了山，雲遊四方，有了些想法，卻又因這世道更加迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"既然有幸能見到先生本尊，小僧便想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你有了些想法，何必再問？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"取長補短，查漏補缺......說實話，小僧還是不解那畫中真意，為何點到末尾瀑布時，一筆飛去，留下數寸空白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"——拙山盡起，便是卷中天地，無限延展之意。末尾一筆飛瀑，直衝天際，只餘留白，是以此來描摹那畫卷描摹不下的大好河山......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，小僧只是自己瞎琢磨的，先生就別賣關子啦，搞得小僧怪不好意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"如何理解，是看客自己的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，只為了這件事......你就費盡如此心思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"人生路上，不過求解再求解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"也虧得這個小小心結，小僧才有幸在先生的畫卷江山中大開眼界，不是好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你問的那一筆，只不過是興起而起，敗興而停，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"當年畫到那飛瀑時，突然不想動筆了，就擱置在那兒。之後再看，覺得無心插柳，頗有情趣，隨意取了個名，丟給你那糊塗師傅罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"——想不到，竟是如此！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"失望了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"在畫中虛度光陰，得來的答案如此無趣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒沒有，且不說畫卷歷程小僧受益匪淺，先生的回答，也有趣得很呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"興起揮筆，敗興停筆......小僧本以為，所有事物都當有其意，久而久之，反而深陷其中，不能自拔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"是了，是了，何必非要糾結此中真意......若是只有那一個答，百思其解，還有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧從師傅那聽來的那句“本來無一物，何處惹塵埃”，是否也是差不多的念想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"人都有自己的那份意思，明白這點，再得意忘形，也不是什麼壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，先生教誨，小僧謹記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"何況，當日贈予你那糊塗師傅的時候，我明明白白說了“拙山盡”三個字，這個“起”字......就是你師傅的意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"“起”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"知道你師傅當時看到了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"不是與先生一併，見過大好山河？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"錯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_thundercloud"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小僧，小僧這是回到了畫中......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，莫非這就是住持爺爺當年看到的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac16_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是......住持爺爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他磨破了腳，餓暈了頭，從這餓殍滿地的荒地間走過，花了三天三夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他誠心祈禱了兩千又二十四次，倒是未曾對自己的生死做過考慮，他只感到悲傷與不解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生您......救了住持爺爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"苦潭江上，我已救過他一次。這次，我沒有幫他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你該想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一個在他那個年紀就見過如此慘劇的小沙彌，是如何能成為你印象裡那個和藹慈祥的住持爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又如何能在那幅畫上，加一個“起”字的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"住持爺爺......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......哀鴻遍野。\n所見，所聞，所語，皆是慘劇。\n昔日年輕的東國僧人，一步一停，念念有詞。\n光陰如水，也在此刻凝滯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨這個名字，是小僧下山前住持爺爺給小僧的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......是了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"見遍人間冷暖而心不墜，天岳崩於前而色不變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"那個小沙彌......回到東國之後，收養了一群無處可去的孩子，在山野間建了寺廟，就變成了你口中的住持爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"不常見的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"那幅畫......江山未盡之意，原來是住持爺爺加上去的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......如此更好！就讓小僧來替住持爺爺，再看一遍這大地風光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，隨你便吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你了卻心結，那便就此離去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等，先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"這不過是小僧本來的疑惑，小僧神遊畫卷十載，一腔胸臆，不吐不快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"但這是你最後一個機會了。我不喜歡太囉嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"畫中人，到底是真是假？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你這問題真有意思。明知是畫中人，何須問真假？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧雖聽那些枯澀經文就會打瞌睡，但也懵懵懂懂記下了“求真”二字......可小僧在先生畫中雲遊數年，卻愈發迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"敢問先生，何為真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你看畫中人，自以為是“真人”看“假人”，那些假的生老病死，皆可一笑而過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果我們也不過是畫中人，隨便哪天便煙消雲散，你還能如此泰然處之？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"人終有一死，又何須為此苦擾？只作當下想，小僧發乎本心，理所當然，自由自在，自然不會有半點惶恐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"人未必自由。我所畫之真真假假，皆是對自我的詰問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"人生當自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"錯，你我皆是畫中人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"只自了，不自知，何真之有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"到頭來，何為真？何為假？你當真分得明白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"那又何必較真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"先生莫非是說......此時此刻，小僧仍在畫中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......你確確實實離開了我的畫卷，此事不假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你如何證明當下這片大地，不是另一幅更無趣的畫卷，僅此而已呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你行過的路，見過的人，生老病死，多舛命途，興許都是某些個執筆人的一時興起，無甚意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你們窮其一生求個所謂的“真”，也不過是那個似我非我的魔怔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這片畫卷裡彎彎繞繞，看客看過了也就看過了，喝彩兩聲，啐口唾沫，如此罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"生皆夢幻，如露似電，無蹤泡影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"......話說得夠多了，你在這虛度光陰，兜兜繞繞，煩人得緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人我會找機會攆出去的，你先走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔施主不遠萬里，只為見先生一面......先生如此不留情面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"與你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本不知道她們為何而來，就莫要摻和了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"——事不過三，嵯峨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"再多說一句，就準備好面壁思過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"可小僧答應過炎熔施主，至少，要將此物交給先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你——這是......！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"......找到啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2014_nian","aliases":["年"]},{"speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","aliases":["夕"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]}]}
